# Git branch naming

When creating or renaming git branches in this repo:

- **Do not use hyphens (`-`)** in branch names.
- Prefer **underscores (`_`)** to separate words, e.g. `feature/modbus_tcp_client`, `fix/rtsp_cam_reload`.
- Keep the usual prefix style when used (`feature/`, `fix/`, etc.); the prefix slash is fine — only hyphen characters are banned.

Examples:

| Avoid | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `feature/mqtt-cloud-probe` | `feature/mqtt_cloud_probe` |
| `fix/ble-mesh-uuid` | `fix/ble_mesh_uuid` |
